<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIA 204-6 AT CLOSE OF PLAY V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 204-6 AT CLOSE OF PLAY V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>KANPUR, India 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 204 for six wickets at close of play on the first day of the third and final test against South Africa at Kanpur's Green Park on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 204-6 (W.Raman 57) v South Africa.</p>
